{"schema":"item/1","id":"itm_ec7adb0647aa2f6a81f6a604","kind":"story_choice","skills":["literacy.reading.retell-a-story"],"band":"easy","role":"guided","family":"adopt:gdl-story-8527:story","view":{"prompt":{"text":"我们的牛潘多"},"start":"n0","nodes":[{"id":"n0","text":"这是恩达洛。 Zhè shì ēn dá luò.","end":false,"choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"下一页","to":"n1"}]},{"id":"n1","text":"恩达洛喜欢看书。 Ēn dá luò xǐhuān kànshū.","end":false,"choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"下一页","to":"n2"}]},{"id":"n2","text":"这是潘多。 Zhè shì pān duō.","end":false,"choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"下一页","to":"n3"}]},{"id":"n3","text":"潘多喜欢吃胡萝卜。 Pān duō xǐhuān chī húluóbo.","end":false,"choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"下一页","to":"n4"}]},{"id":"n4","text":"恩达洛放学后带潘多吃草。 Ēn dá luò fàngxué hòu dài pān duō chī cǎo.","end":false,"choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"下一页","to":"n5"}]},{"id":"n5","text":"他给潘多喝清水。 Tā gěi pān duō hē qīngshuǐ.","end":false,"choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"下一页","to":"n6"}]},{"id":"n6","text":"父亲给潘多谷物。 Fùqīn gěi pān duō gǔwù.","end":false,"choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"下一页","to":"n7"}]},{"id":"n7","text":"他每天都会给潘多挤奶。 Tā měitiān dūhuì gěi pān duō jǐ nǎi.","end":false,"choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"下一页","to":"n8"}]},{"id":"n8","text":"潘多提供了很多牛奶。 Pān duō tígōngle hěnduō niúnǎi.","end":false,"choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"下一页","to":"n9"}]},{"id":"n9","text":"父亲出售潘多的牛奶。 Fùqīn chūshòu pān duō de niúnǎi.","end":false,"choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"下一页","to":"n10"}]},{"id":"n10","text":"恩达洛每天都会喝新鲜的牛奶。 Ēn dá luò měitiān dūhuì hē xīnxiān de niúnǎi.","end":false,"choices":[{"id":"c0","label":"下一页","to":"n11"}]},{"id":"n11","text":"他说：“谢谢你，潘多！” Tā shuō： “xièxiè nǐ, pān duō!”","end":true,"choices":[]}]},"key":{"graded":false,"hints":[]},"status":"draft","provenance":{"origin":"generator","maker":"openlessons-adopt","tool":"openlessons adopt","created":"2026-11-23"}}
